I've got the same sex clover... well, really.

503
00:30:28,128 --> 00:30:31,048
I'm surprised when I go to a stranger's house.

504
00:30:31,048 --> 00:30:31,688
You know...

505
00:30:31,688 --> 00:30:34,208
The first time I ate cheesecake...

506
00:30:34,208 --> 00:30:37,208
I ate cheesecake for the first time because my mother bought it for me.

507
00:30:37,208 --> 00:30:40,208
I was eating cheesecake all the time.

508
00:30:40,728 --> 00:30:43,728
I didn't usually eat cheesecake at all.

509
00:30:48,008 --> 00:30:49,408
Well, well, well, well...

510
00:30:51,504 --> 00:31:01,384
So, for those of you who are still here, if you have any letters, please send them to me.

511
00:31:01,384 --> 00:31:09,824
I'll see you all next week.

512
00:31:09,824 --> 00:31:17,464
Thank you very much for your time this week.

513
00:31:22,170 --> 00:31:25,170
Thank you very much for your time this week.
